spec: format-reference.md#show
note: the object type is probed in the order commit, dirtree, dirmeta, file, so a
 checksum naming nothing reports the last probe's failure. In `bare` the line
 carries the `Opening content object` prefix every mode but `archive` adds, which
 the next cell states without it. This is the one reading command where the
 absent-object wording agrees: `log` and `ls` resolve a commit and draw the pair
 cli-surface.md, "P1" records.

