 group header an emptied group keeps, a quoted `remote "x"` group reached through
 the `section.key` form, and the tool reading the document the port rewrote. The
 test compares the two `config` files byte for byte at every step.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# remote -- the configured remotes and their trusted keys (Phase 17e).
