 report, `--raw`, `--list-metadata-keys`, three `--print-metadata-key` forms, and
 the refusal a remote publishing no summary draws. The timestamps in the report
 are the one divergence: the tool renders them in the host time zone and the port
 in UTC, so the test fixes `TZ=UTC` (`cli-surface.md`, "P3").

