expect-exit: 0
expect-stderr: empty
oracle: exit-status checksum-agreement
outcome: full
severity: interop
identity: full
spec: format-reference.md#commit
note: `-m` is stored verbatim in the commit's body field, so the agreeing
 checksum states the stored bytes.

